{"created": "2026-03-05T14:43:51.484060+00:00", "modified": "2026-03-05T14:43:51.895136+00:00", "id": 18871460, "conceptrecid": "18871459", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18871460", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.18871459", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18871460", "metadata": {"title": "Urban Community Issues Object Detection Dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18871460", "publication_date": "2026-03-05", "description": "<p>This dataset contains annotated images for training object detection models focused on road infrastructure and urban environments. It is designed for applications such as smart city monitoring, road safety systems, and infrastructure damage detection. The dataset is provided in&nbsp;<strong>YOLO</strong>&nbsp;format and is compatible with popular models like&nbsp;<strong>YOLOv5</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>YOLOv8</strong>, and other Ultralytics-based detectors.</p>\n<p><strong>Each image has a corresponding .txt label file following YOLO annotation format.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>### Dataset Size</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Class</th>\n<th>Number of Images</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Animal</td>\n<td>600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traffic Light</td>\n<td>600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waste Container</td>\n<td>600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pothole</td>\n<td>300</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cracks</td>\n<td>166</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Open Manhole</td>\n<td>152</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Good Road</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Note: The dataset is imbalanced across classes. Users may apply augmentation techniques if needed.</strong></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Paudel, Rajeev", "affiliation": null}], "contributors": [{"name": "Pandey, Abishek", "affiliation": null, "type": "ResearchGroup"}, {"name": "Paudel, Rajeev", "affiliation": null, "type": "ProjectLeader"}], "keywords": ["computer vision", "object detection", "YOLO", "road safety", "pothole detection", "machine learning", "da